  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    ACTS Common Course - CHEM 1424.\n\nPrerequisite: A grade of C or better in CHEM 2124 or equivalent, or approval of the instructor. \n\nCo-requisite: CHEM 2130.\n\nA continuation of CHEM 2124, encompassing chemical kinetics, equilibrium, acid/base systems, atmospheric chemistry, thermodynamics, electrochemistry, descriptive inorganic chemistry and nuclear chemistry. \n\nLecture three hours, laboratory three hours.  $40 laboratory fee.\n    \n</section>",
